        ('12020000-0000-4000-8000-0000000003fb', v_class_id, 'Class 12 Chemistry Chapter Mock: Biomolecules - Set 1 (Foundation & NCERT Concepts)', 45, 25, 0.00, false, 'Chemistry', 'CHAPTER_WISE', 'Class 12', 'Time Allowed: 45 Minutes. Maximum Marks: 25. Chapter-Focused CBSE Pattern Assessment for "Biomolecules". Attempt all questions in Sections A to E with step-by-step solutions.', 'Chapter Mock (25M): Biomolecules - Set 1'),
